{"unit_id": "tag:06EB:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。\n若<MATH_0002>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的且为满射（surjective），则\n<MATH_0003>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指态射两端的对象。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指两个概形之间的态射。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "用作引理中的态射假设。"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "用作引理中的态射假设。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06EB:proof", "translation": "我们有<MATH_0001>，见引理<REF_0001>。\n设<MATH_0002>是一个有限型点（finite type point）。由于<MATH_0003>是满射（surjective），概形（scheme）<MATH_0004>非空（nonempty），因而有一个有限型点（finite type point）<MATH_0005>（见引理<REF_0002>）。\n现在，<MATH_0006>是有限型（finite type）态射（morphism），因为它是<MATH_0007>的基变换（base change）（引理<REF_0003>）。\n因此，<MATH_0008>在<MATH_0009>中的像（image）是一个有限型点（finite type point）（见引理<REF_0004>），且按构造该点映射（maps）到<MATH_0010>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "nonempty", "target_term": "非空"}, {"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点", "context": "证明中起初选定的点。"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "用于推出所述概形非空。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指由满射性得知非空的概形。"}, {"source_term": "nonempty", "target_term": "非空", "context": "描述所述概形的性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点", "context": "所述非空概形中存在的点。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "基变换所得态射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指基变换所得的态射。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "说明所得态射与原态射的关系。"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "指所选点在另一对象中的像。"}, {"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点", "context": "描述所选点的像。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "表示该点按构造所去的点。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02J4:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。\n对于任意局部闭子集（closed subset）<MATH_0002>，有\n<MATH_0003>\n特别地，对于任意闭子集（closed subset）<MATH_0004>，<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>中稠密（dense）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "dense", "target_term": "稠密"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指引理起初给定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "此处受前置的“局部”限定。"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "指特别情形所量化的子集。"}, {"source_term": "dense", "target_term": "稠密", "context": "描述特别情形中的稠密性。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02J4:proof", "translation": "注意，<MATH_0001>带有一种概形（scheme）结构（见《概形（Schemes）》中的引理<REF_0001>），使得<MATH_0002>是局部闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n任意局部闭浸入（closed immersion）都是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的，见引理<REF_0002>。\n因此，由引理<REF_0003>可得<MATH_0003>。\n最后，<MATH_0004>的任一非空（nonempty）仿射开集（affine open）至少有一个闭点（closed point），该点是<MATH_0005>的有限型点（finite type point）（见引理<REF_0004>）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "nonempty", "target_term": "非空"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "用于说明所述对象所带的结构类型。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "用作被引引理所在的章名。"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "该处术语受前置的“局部”限定，用于描述配备概形结构后所得的态射。"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "该处术语受前置的“局部”限定，指下一条引理适用的一类态射。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "指所述浸入满足的性质。"}, {"source_term": "nonempty", "target_term": "非空", "context": "限定所考察的仿射开集。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指末句所量化的开集。"}, {"source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点", "context": "指所述开集中至少存在的一个点。"}, {"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点", "context": "描述该闭点相对于所述对象的性质。"}], "notes": []}
